  "mechanism": "sys_timerfd_create passes the raw clock ID to TimerfdFile::new, which calls the POSIX-timer helper create_timer, and that helper accepts CLOCK_PROCESS_CPUTIME_ID and CLOCK_THREAD_CPUTIME_ID, so timerfd_create returns an FD for clocks Linux rejects.",
