  "contract": "timerfd_create(2): clockid must be CLOCK_REALTIME, CLOCK_MONOTONIC, CLOCK_BOOTTIME, CLOCK_REALTIME_ALARM or CLOCK_BOOTTIME_ALARM, and Linux returns EINVAL for the two CPU-time clocks.",
  "observed": "By source reading at the pin (not run): timerfd_create(CLOCK_PROCESS_CPUTIME_ID or CLOCK_THREAD_CPUTIME_ID) succeeds.",
